<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n91235" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτόρθ-ος</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>young branch, shoot, sucker,
				sapling</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				6.128
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὥς τις π. ηὐξόμην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hec.</u>
					20
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτόρθοισι δάφνης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ion</u>
					103
				</span></i>
			 (anap.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαλάχης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					544
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἱ π. καὶ οἱ νέοι κλῶνες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Prt.</u>
					334b
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				5.1.3
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πτόρθους ἁπαλοὺς ἀποτρώγουσαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eup.
					14.2
				</span></i>
			: generally, <i>branch</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>PA</u>
				687a2
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. μέγας</span>, of
			Heracles' club, <i><span class="en">
				<u>APl.</u>
				4.103
			</span></i> (Tull. <i><span class="en">
				Gem.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>sprouting, budding</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Op.</u>
				421
			</span></i>.</div>
